-- ============================================================
-- AI School - clean rebuild of the customer-service data (2026-10-09)
-- Wipes: leads, their stage events / call attempts, teacher slots, WhatsApp
-- message log.  Keeps: users, finance, subscriptions (re-linked by phone),
-- teachers, WhatsApp templates and settings.
-- Rules: one row per booking (a phone can have several: siblings / repeat
-- attendance); every lecture of the teachers' sheet is a booking; phones
-- of extra bookings come from the «الحجوزات» sheet (first name match).
-- attended -> stage interested (عملاء مهتمون); did not attend ->
-- attendance_recorded (stays in الحجوزات); pending / old "تم الحجز" -> booked.
-- TAKE A DB BACKUP FIRST.
-- ============================================================
